1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:04,267
Every day starts with a question. Usually before coffee.

2
00:00:04,533 --> 00:00:06,667
So you open ChatGPT.

3
00:00:06,967 --> 00:00:10,633
Some questions are small… is my sourdough starter dead?

4
00:00:10,900 --> 00:00:12,767
It’s not. It’s just hungry.

5
00:00:13,067 --> 00:00:14,867
Some are just Monday.

6
00:00:15,100 --> 00:00:20,300
A whiteboard full of half-ideas… and ChatGPT turns it into a plan.

7
00:00:20,600 --> 00:00:23,267
And some only come out at 3 a.m. …

8
00:00:23,467 --> 00:00:27,600
when the house is quiet, and you need the right words for someone you love.

9
00:00:27,933 --> 00:00:31,167
Emails. Dinner. Trips. Bugs.

10
00:00:31,400 --> 00:00:35,533
Big questions, silly ones, the ones you’d never say out loud.

11
00:00:35,767 --> 00:00:37,100
Whatever’s on your mind…

12
00:00:37,300 --> 00:00:39,767
ChatGPT. Ask anything.
